source: aquafix/tests/sections.rs
expression: render(app)
---
<section id="reviews" class="w-full px-[var(--page-px)] light bg-card text-ink py-[var(--band-py)]" data-slot="section"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-primary" data-slot="eyebrow">612 GOOGLE REVIEWS · 4.9 AVERAGE</p><h2 class="font-display [font-weight:700] max-w-[54rem] tracking-[-0.005em] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] text-[calc(1.5625rem*var(--display-scale))] md:text-[calc(2.625rem*var(--display-scale))]" data-slot="display">Read the one-star ones too.</h2></div><div id="elfsight-google-reviews" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[var(--radius)] border-[1.5px] border-dashed border-primary px-5 pb-[18px] pt-4 md:px-6"><p class="text-[10.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">ELFSIGHT GOOGLE REVIEWS WIDGET — LIVE EMBED · RESERVED HEIGHT 400PX · CARDS BELOW ARE THE VISUAL TARGET</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row"><div class="text-ink flex-col border py-6 shadow-sm flex-1 gap-3.5 rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-background px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px] hidden md:flex" data-slot="card"><p class="text-[17px] text-primary">★★★★★</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Nate found the leak in twenty minutes after two other companies told me I would have to dig up the driveway. Quoted $265. Charged $265.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Sarah K.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">Beaverton · Burst pipe · 2 weeks ago</p></div></div><div class="text-ink flex-col border py-6 shadow-sm flex-1 gap-3.5 rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-background px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px] hidden md:flex" data-slot="card"><p class="text-[17px] text-primary">★★★★★</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Booked the 8–10am window, van pulled up at 8:20. New hot water unit in before lunch. The price on the website is the price I actually paid.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Danny R.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">SE Portland · Hot water · 1 month ago</p></div></div><div class="text-ink flex flex-col border py-6 shadow-sm flex-1 gap-3.5 rounded-[var(--control-radius)] bg-background px-6 pb-6 pt-[22px]" data-slot="card"><p class="text-[17px] text-primary">★★★★☆</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-ink">Four stars only because they could not come out until the next morning. Everything else was exactly as advertised, right down to the boot covers.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px]"><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">Priya M.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-soft">Lake Oswego · Blocked drain · 3 weeks ago</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
